&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; line-height: 14px; margin-right: 4px; text-align: center"&gt;対象となる&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; line-height: 14px; margin-right: 4px; text-align: center"&gt;役員の員数&lt;/p&gt;
